const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究用自编码器在大规模资产收益与特征面板中刻画条件因子暴露和共同成分的框架。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article studies an autoencoder framework for modeling conditional factor exposures and common components in a large panel of asset returns and characteristics. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它结合非线性表征学习和资产定价结构，潜在维度、训练目标、样本切分、因子解释和条件信息都属于设计。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It combines nonlinear representation learning with an asset-pricing structure, so the latent dimension, training objective, sample split, factor interpretation, and conditioning information are part of the design. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要时点一致的收益和特征面板、样本成员与退市、因子或测试资产定义、缺失处理、宏观条件变量以及按时间的验证区间。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"A faithful extension needs a point-in-time returns-and-characteristics panel, universe membership and delistings, factor or test-asset definitions, missing-data treatment, macro conditioning variables, and chronological validation periods. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源提出估计潜在条件定价结构的方法，不会让潜在特征自动成为可观测经济因子或保证样本外收益。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source presents a way to estimate latent conditional pricing structure; it does not make latent features observable economic factors or guarantee out-of-sample returns. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留特征版本和缩放；避免横截面与时间泄漏；最终测试前冻结架构和调参；报告缺失与存续偏差；比较已声明的基准。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Preserve feature vintages and scaling; avoid cross-sectional and temporal leakage; freeze architecture and tuning choices before the final test; report missingness and survivorship; and compare to stated benchmarks. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Econometrics · DOI record。学习到的表征依赖模型和样本，不是实时信号、因果机制，也不能替代数据血缘和实施审查。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Econometrics · DOI record. A learned representation is model- and sample-dependent, not a live signal, causal mechanism, or replacement for data-lineage and implementation review. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.07.009",label:{zh:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Econometrics · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Autoencoder Asset Pricing Models”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。学习到的表征依赖模型和样本，不是实时信号、因果机制，也不能替代数据血缘和实施审查。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Autoencoder Asset Pricing Models”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
